			"difficulty": "per/a",
			"points": 4,
			"local_notes": "Racial skill at Per+1, level 11."
		}
	],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nc-dJiLvRi2NnR3ly",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 2, DX 14, IQ 3, HT 11, HP 2, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n75s_jRXDKPaO3R_X",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 5, protection -7), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nlGI_k3F9afFRkKpZ",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/viper-snake.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "ncBPxGxmu-qc9kSvY",
			"text": "Independent build total: -95 points of racial traits plus 20 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n518VrTcnzqnZBoAa",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Poisonous Snake (SRD 5.1); Viper Snake (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "njooX97eQqXhmUGvb",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nazUqrBjb2p7mj44t",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 1 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nVyTTI58jrdf73WBn",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nSLTtTvvT0qlN7bJl",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nv64k814K5tST8w7_",
			"text": "About 90 cm, which is the SM -2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_8CyvGK5_RL7WVCT",
			"text": "The 5.1 corpus prints this as 'Poisonous Snake' and the 3.5 corpus as 'Viper Snake'; both are this record."
		},
		{
			"id": "nwBInpYmhPyTTciDb",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1nvUY9pN_1uCwjfk",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
